"BEAT-02","SQ-01","2","PROTAGONIST","Cross an unvisited ravine before night and understand the burned construction.","A player-built stone shell and descending stair contradict the map edge and private-world history.","He follows the surviving geometry towards purple light rather than leaving.","CE-01","Ground the title mystery in persistent environment rather than a person.","The ruin has practical construction logic but no available builder.","L-shaped foundation, granite notch, stone chest recess and missing timber align above the ravine.","Wind and footsteps yield gradually to a portal hum.","80","SC-02"
